+    // defect lives on the synthetic `click()` that Enter/Space and an assistive technology's
+    // "press" dispatch: WebKit then moves focus to `body` with no `focusout` on the ring's path,
+    // and without the check a ring stays on the tab through settle (0 px from it, focus on body).
