+/**
+ * ONE DRAWN RING OFF THE BOARD (T9-W7 §6).
+ *
+ * The board draws focus in its own hand (`gameCell.css` tier 2); everywhere else the estate
+ * drew it six different ways — a 2px solid here, a dashed one there, a `color-mix` 40% on the
+ * logo and 45% on the guard face — and three of those read under 3:1 on their ground. This is
