+ *   1. the owner the focused control DECLARES — `aria-activedescendant`. The deck is such a
+ *      listbox: DOM focus never leaves its 1056px scrollport, so a focusin-only ring frames
+ *      the scrollport and never moves on ArrowRight. The card is the owner, and the
+ *      accessibility tree already says so.
